option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Sunlight and moonlight cast shadows. Turning them off saves the most performance.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Sharper shadows with higher values, at a cost of performance.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How far away shadows are drawn, in blocks.
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES=Shadow Quality
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES.comment=More samples make soft shadow edges smoother.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Path Angle
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Tilts the path of the sun and moon so that shadows fall at an angle.
option.SSAO_SAMPLES=Ambient Occlusion
option.SSAO_SAMPLES.comment=Darkens corners and gaps for more depth. 0 turns it off.
option.SSAO_STRENGTH=Ambient Occlusion Strength
option.WAVING_PLANTS=Waving Plants
option.WAVING_PLANTS.comment=Leaves and grass move in the wind.
option.CLOUD_STEPS=Volumetric Clouds
option.CLOUD_STEPS.comment=Real 3D clouds. Higher values look smoother and cost more. 0 keeps the vanilla clouds.
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cloud Coverage
option.VL_STEPS=Light Rays
option.VL_STEPS.comment=Sun rays through trees and fog. 0 turns them off.
option.VL_DENSITY=Light Ray Strength
option.FOG_DENSITY=Fog Density
option.STARS=Stars
option.STAR_DENSITY=Star Density
option.NEBULA=Nebula
option.NEBULA.comment=A glowing band of the galaxy across the night sky.
option.AURORA=Aurora
option.WATER_WAVES=Water Waves
option.SSR_STEPS=Water Reflections
option.SSR_STEPS.comment=Water reflects the terrain around it. 0 reflects only the sky.
option.TAA=Temporal Anti-Aliasing
option.TAA.comment=Smooths edges and removes flickering by blending several frames.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom
option.EXPOSURE=Exposure
option.SATURATION=Saturation
